{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云云何諸有起，謂起三有也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏云云何因生果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏云真如無次第"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云道理有幾種，解釋有幾種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能想是心，所想是境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即從能想所想而起斷常二見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得即四果，向即四向"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即林樹蔓草聰明等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩數句，一是筭數之數，一是數量之數。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云作是觀已\n離分別緣亦離妄心所取名義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云知身及物并所住處一切皆是藏識所現，無能所取及生住滅，如是\n思惟恒住不捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故四、五、八無法亦無人，六、七二執甚均平"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻第八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻無明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻器界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻根身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徧計"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云無種生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即五大也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即十一根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即五微也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即五微也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前\n言說妄想是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前因緣增上緣等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云：聖亦不如凡所分別如是得故，非自所行\n境界相故。彼亦見有諸法性相，如妄執性而顯現故，不說有因及無因故，墮於諸法性相見故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏云：\n餘人見境不如是見如是說者，有無窮過。何以故？以不覺知所有法相無自體故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏云亦非分別有法體相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云諸法性相不因分別，云何而言以分別故而有諸法？諸法相異，妄想相異，\n云何諸法而有分別？復以何故，凡愚分別不如是實有矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云令眾生捨分別說。如分別\n所見法相無如是法，何故令眾生離有無見所執著法，而復執著聖智境界墮於有見？何以故？不說寂靜空無\n之法，而說聖智自性事故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂斷分別我執，證初果，從是次第斷三界八十\n一品思惑，得寂滅定，得四果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂斷\n分別我法二執，得入初地，名見道，從是次第斷俱生我法二執，至八地得滅盡定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即六粗智相相續相也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即六粗執取相計名字\n相也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即六粗起業相及業繫苦相也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "J27nB200_p0582c23"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X17n0331_p0803b04"}
{"id": null, "n": "0806001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0806001", "type": "mod", "text": "說【CB】，脫【卍續】，脫經作說"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0801001", "type": "orig", "text": "耳疑兒"}
{"id": null, "n": "0802001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0802001 #note_star_1 #note_star_2", "type": "orig", "text": "那疑耶次下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0802002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0802002 #note_star_3", "type": "orig", "text": "摩疑羅次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0802003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0802003", "type": "orig", "text": "摩婆羅疑羅婆那"}
{"id": null, "n": "0803001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0803001", "type": "orig", "text": "那疑耶"}
{"id": null, "n": "0805001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0805001", "type": "orig", "text": "說經作聽"}
{"id": null, "n": "0806001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0806001", "type": "orig", "text": "脫經作說"}
{"id": null, "n": "0811001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0811001", "type": "orig", "text": "句經作伎"}
{"id": null, "n": "0811002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0811002", "type": "orig", "text": "非下經有工巧伎術四字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0812001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0812001 #note_star_4", "type": "orig", "text": "󳬂樹藤經作藂葛藤次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0826001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0826001", "type": "orig", "text": "經無妄字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0834001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0834001", "type": "orig", "text": "來宜作還"}
{"id": null, "n": "0835001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0835001", "type": "orig", "text": "二疑一"}
{"id": null, "n": "0835002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0835002", "type": "orig", "text": "婆疑剩字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0845001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0845001", "type": "orig", "text": "忘經作念"}
{"id": null, "n": "0856001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0856001", "type": "orig", "text": "而故疑倒"}
{"id": null, "n": "0864001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0864001", "type": "orig", "text": "除疑餘"}
{"id": null, "n": "0866001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0866001", "type": "orig", "text": "得疑在"}
{"id": null, "n": "0867001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0867001", "type": "orig", "text": "自疑剩字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0873001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0873001", "type": "orig", "text": "乎疑平"}
{"id": null, "n": "0887001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0887001", "type": "orig", "text": "經無大慧等五字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0890001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0890001", "type": "orig", "text": "量經作設"}
{"id": null, "n": "0891001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0891001", "type": "orig", "text": "授通說疑說通授"}
{"id": null, "n": "0891002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0891002", "type": "orig", "text": "訶疑阿"}
{"id": null, "n": "0898001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0898001", "type": "orig", "text": "水疑火"}
{"id": null, "n": "0899001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0899001", "type": "orig", "text": "歿疑沒"}
{"id": null, "n": "0901001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0901001", "type": "orig", "text": "破疑暗"}
{"id": null, "n": "0907001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0907001", "type": "orig", "text": "其疑共"}
{"id": null, "n": "0912001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0912001", "type": "orig", "text": "旧版コノ字欠落，〔等〕カ。󴦒"}
{"id": null, "n": "0912002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0912002", "type": "orig", "text": "果疑界"}
{"id": null, "n": "0913001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0913001", "type": "orig", "text": "之經作行"}
{"id": null, "n": "0914001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0914001", "type": "orig", "text": "來下經有藏字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0915001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0915001", "type": "orig", "text": "眾伎經作伎眾"}
{"id": null, "n": "0916001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0916001", "type": "orig", "text": "之疑云"}
{"id": null, "n": "0916002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0916002", "type": "orig", "text": "滅疑減"}
{"id": null, "n": "0919001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0919001", "type": "orig", "text": "輪疑轉"}
{"id": null, "n": "0921001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0921001", "type": "orig", "text": "壁疑檗"}
{"id": null, "n": "0923001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0923001", "type": "orig", "text": "而經作向"}
{"id": null, "n": "0925001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0925001", "type": "orig", "text": "當經作常"}
{"id": null, "n": "0925002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0925002", "type": "orig", "text": "巳疑故"}
{"id": null, "n": "0926001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0926001", "type": "orig", "text": "血經作肉"}
{"id": null, "n": "0926002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0926002", "type": "orig", "text": "餘經作於"}
{"id": null, "n": "0926003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0926003", "type": "orig", "text": "膺經作鷹"}
{"id": null, "n": "0926004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0926004", "type": "orig", "text": "善經作之"}
{"id": null, "n": "0926005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0926005", "type": "orig", "text": "當經作常"}
{"id": null, "n": "0926006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0926006", "type": "orig", "text": "不經作可"}
